{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-eurowrap-25pk-blue-party-balloons-2608-0108","content_id":"5a2b6381-4e82-4a6c-905a-8ce98f9d087a","description":"Product Recall for Eurowrap 25pk Blue Party Balloons presenting a chemical risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"70bdd2a9-63d6-4711-bfdd-846112e57dde","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-14T11:35:16+01:00","id":"70bdd2a9-63d6-4711-bfdd-846112e57dde","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-14T11:35:16+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7eef6492ec93e1e03299f6/2608-0108-product-recall-eurowrap-25pk-party-balloons.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Eurowrap 25pk Blue Party Balloons</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk because it contains excess N-nitrosamines and N-nitrosatable substances.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Eurowrap.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Toys/Games Variety Packs</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Eurowrap</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch/Lot Number</td>\n      <td>5330002193</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>SKU/Product Code</td>\n      <td>12924-BCC</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Pack of 25 party balloons.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_70bdd2a9-63d6-4711-bfdd-846112e57dde\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7eef6492ec93e1e03299f6/2608-0108-product-recall-eurowrap-25pk-party-balloons.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk because it contains excess N-nitrosamines and N-nitrosatable substances. Nitrosamines are carcinogenic, and users can be exposed through ingestion or dermal exposure. A child could be exposed to them when touching or putting the product in the mouth.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Eurowrap. Consumers should stop using the product immediately and keep it out of reach of children. Return the product to the retailer for a full refund or replacement.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access the Eurowrap website at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.eurowrap.com/news/important-safety-warning\">https://www.eurowrap.com/news/important-safety-warning</a> or contact Eurowrap at: <a href=\"mailto:contact@eurowrap.com\">contact@eurowrap.com</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2608-0108</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-14T10:35:56Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-14","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-14T11:35:56+01:00","lin